<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="row justify-content-center py-4">
  <div class="col-lg-9 col-md-11">
    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5 bg-white">
      <h2 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-3">Terms of Service</h2>
      <p class="text-muted small mb-4">Last Updated: October 2026</p>

      <div class="text-secondary" style="line-height: 1.8;">
        <h5 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-2">1. Community Good Faith &amp; Honesty</h5>
        <p class="small mb-3">
          The Lost &amp; Found Portal relies upon community trust and integrity. Submitting false reports, attempting to claim belongings that do not belong to you, or impersonating owners is strictly prohibited.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-2">2. Handover and Safe Recovery</h5>
        <p class="small mb-3">
          Users agree to coordinate physical handovers in safe, well-lit public areas or at designated campus/organization lost-and-found security repositories. The portal serves as a communication and verification bridge.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-2">3. Moderation and Account Suspension</h5>
        <p class="small mb-3">
          Administrators reserve the right to review, edit, reject, or remove inappropriate listings, and to suspend user accounts that engage in fraudulent claims or abusive behavior.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-2">4. Disclaimers</h5>
        <p class="small mb-0">
          The portal is provided on an "as is" basis to facilitate community recovery. Users should exercise due caution when verifying claims for high-value belongings.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

